  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>At the time of emission, if the source and observer line is making an angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></math> with the line of motion of source, then<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/450195-11.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 197px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>app</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>–</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mi>cosθ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>lcosθ</mi></math></p><p>[As this sound is heard by observer when source is at <em><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></em>]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mi>cosθ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>app</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>–</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br />Putting the values, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi>app</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
